SMS marketing software, also known as text message marketing, helps companies plan and execute mobile-focused marketing campaigns by sending targeted, permission-based SMS and MMS messages to customers and prospects. These tools support personalized outreach, bulk messaging, and two-way messaging to drive customer engagement and loyalty.

SMS marketing software often functions within broader omnichannel journey orchestration, using customer data to deliver coordinated and personalized customer experiences. Modern platforms leverage AI for content generation, predictive send-time optimization, behavioral segmentation, and can work with conversational marketing software to enable businesses to engage customers through personalized two-way messaging and automated responses.

Core capabilities of SMS marketing software
To qualify for inclusion in the SMS Marketing category, a product must:

Reach mobile users via SMS messaging
Provide an opt-in opportunity for new subscribers
Track interaction data related to each SMS campaign
Provide analytics or insights into SMS marketing efforts
Common use cases for SMS marketing software
Sending promotional messages, discounts, and limited-time offers to drive immediate customer action
Running bulk outreach campaigns to announce product launches, seasonal sales, or important updates
Delivering personalized reminders for appointments, reservations, renewals, or order pickups
Supporting two-way customer communication for inquiries, feedback collection, and service interactions
Sending transactional alerts such as order confirmations, shipping updates, and payment notifications
Managing subscriber lists, opt-ins, and segmented audience groups for targeted messaging
Conducting quick surveys, polls, and SMS-based engagement activities to gather customer insights
Enhancing omnichannel marketing strategies by complementing email, social, and push notifications with timely text outreach
Re-engaging inactive customers through personalized follow-up messages or win-back campaigns
How SMS marketing software differs from other tools
SMS marketing software focuses specifically on mobile messaging, enabling marketers to deliver timely, personalized texts at scale and support digital promotions such as polls, coupons, and surveys. While many tools integrate through APIs or appear as features within platforms like marketing automation software or email marketing software, businesses needing deeper mobile engagement may also consider mobile communication channels such as WhatsApp marketing software, RCS business messaging software, push notification software, and mobile marketing software.

